    "id": "p29-q21-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "21",
    "prompt": "Find the mass of $0.8\\text{ L}$ of water if one litre weighs $1.0005\\text{ kg}$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$0.8004\\text{ kg}$",
      "worked": "$10005\\times8=80040$. The factors have five decimal places altogether.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Mass}&=1.0005\\times0.8\\text{ kg}\\\\\\text{Mass}&=0.80040\\text{ kg}\\\\\\text{Mass}&=0.8004\\text{ kg}\\end{align*}$$",
